    "detailed_description": "<h1>Steamdeck</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745810/extras/fcce3fed6819503b95af69ca8d713fdc.avif?t=1755375980\" width=800 height=194 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745810/extras/802c79a3b14b15c1d785a3a1a04104c0.avif?t=1755375980\" width=800 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To fight off the goblin invasion, the town\u2019s elegant lady and a shrine maiden joined forces to summon monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They abducted you and made you responsible for raising monster eggs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One egg after another, your strange new life begins to grow on you\u2026 and so do the girls who dragged you into it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745810/extras/d4a5617a23d48a6c8a8a812108629157.avif?t=1755375980\" width=800 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.Pull Eggs \u2013 Draw random-quality monster eggs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 2.Incubate \u2013 Let time work its magic as your eggs grow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 3.Sell Monsters \u2013 Exchange grown monsters for rewards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 4.Collection \u2013 Complete two full monster collections (200 \u00d7 2)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 5.Quests \u2013 Clear missions to unlock character events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 6.Lo-fi Beats \u2013 30 chill tracks to keep you company while idling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745810/extras/39755090d619da43aca9f550e0127d08.avif?t=1755375980\" width=800 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745810/extras/d32f50e4dbb45f45d91a9e3c47c287c1.avif?t=1755375980\" width=800 height=546 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745810/extras/1f1c605386773d117041129ca255adb4.avif?t=1755375980\" width=800 height=546 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745810/extras/9a54bcc32dd2a923b34f19c7add1078b.avif?t=1755375980\" width=800 height=546 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745810/extras/802c79a3b14b15c1d785a3a1a04104c0.avif?t=1755375980\" width=800 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To fight off the goblin invasion, the town\u2019s elegant lady and a shrine maiden joined forces to summon monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They abducted you and made you responsible for raising monster eggs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One egg after another, your strange new life begins to grow on you\u2026 and so do the girls who dragged you into it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745810/extras/d4a5617a23d48a6c8a8a812108629157.avif?t=1755375980\" width=800 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.Pull Eggs \u2013 Draw random-quality monster eggs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 2.Incubate \u2013 Let time work its magic as your eggs grow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 3.Sell Monsters \u2013 Exchange grown monsters for rewards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 4.Collection \u2013 Complete two full monster collections (200 \u00d7 2)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 5.Quests \u2013 Clear missions to unlock character events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 6.Lo-fi Beats \u2013 30 chill tracks to keep you company while idling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745810/extras/39755090d619da43aca9f550e0127d08.avif?t=1755375980\" width=800 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745810/extras/d32f50e4dbb45f45d91a9e3c47c287c1.avif?t=1755375980\" width=800 height=546 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745810/extras/1f1c605386773d117041129ca255adb4.avif?t=1755375980\" width=800 height=546 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745810/extras/9a54bcc32dd2a923b34f19c7add1078b.avif?t=1755375980\" width=800 height=546 /></span></p>",
